  "details": "Would it be possible to make asking for Date of Birth to be a bannable offense? The Age Verification system exists and asking for DoB can be considered PII as many institutions such as bank and medical will sometimes ask for DoB for positive ID verification process. Besides, there is no way to verify if someone is 18+ just by verbal confirmation so it still allows minors in.\n\nAnd the only people asking for DoB are virtual bouncers who are power tripping. There is no reason to comply with such unreasonable demands by unreasonable users or kicked from public worlds. Thank you for taking the time to read this.",
